# TASK/SYSINFO01, TeraDesk (#Z C:\Apps\TERADESK\DESKTOP.NAP) with the
# card's two accessories: hover "Desk" (26,9) -> the application's Desk
# drop-down with the accessory entries; click the first (60,66) -> AC_OPEN ->
# the SYSINFO01 dialog over TeraDesk; Return closes it.
# Ticks hz_200 after the injector arms (the first accessory, session start).
# (measurement-2026-10-07-acctitle/method/tera.actions, mark names changed.)
100 parkbr
3600 mark T00_UP
3700 move 26 9
4100 mark T01_DESK_OPEN
4200 move 60 66
4400 down
4403 up
5400 mark T02_DIALOG
5600 key 1C
5606 key 9C
6200 mark T03_CLOSED
6300 parkbr
6600 mark END
